/**
 * Business — The Operating Manual.
 * Sixth major NDR editorial publication.
 *
 * Phase 2B — the operating divisions flow from the CMS-managed
 * `business-verticals` collection (regenerated byte-identically into
 * `./generated/businessVerticals`), the masthead as-on/edition line from the
 * `publication-settings` collection, and each division's proof-metric
 * references resolve against the shared `metrics` ledger (§11.3) via the
 * frozen `VERTICAL_PROOF_METRIC_KEYS` index. Editorial copy that has no CMS
 * counterpart — the chapter architecture, masthead statement, capability
 * matrix, corporate structure, capital deployment and execution frameworks —
 * stays frozen.
 */

